{
 "note": "Mutants of the six original maps that the site serves for the Map Maker's 'Start from a game map' and of the words that the editor says when a map does not come, for tools/mutate.py (docs/WORKFLOW.md, 'Mutation checks'). Run from the checkout with a built ants_server: python3 tools/mutate.py tests/data/original_maps_mutants.json --keep-going --jobs 1. Every mutant must be caught: each breaks one rule of docs/SERVER.md ('The site's nginx') or docs/MAP_EDITOR.md (mapmaker_store.js, fetchMap). No mutant changes a map of the library: the files they change are the Dockerfile, docker/nginx.conf and the editor's script.",
 "defaults": {
  "test": "python3 tests/scripts/test_nginx_original_maps.py"
 },
